OL,11,G0232 The Climate Question
OL,12,     FThe big climate summit in Turkey
OL,13,     Fhas failed because of a row about
OL,14,     Feven mentioning fossil fuel
OL,15,     Femissions. Is there a way the
OL,16,     Fworld can move forward with
OL,17,     Fclimate action?
