OL,11,G0350 Witness History
OL,12,     FIn 2010, Liberia's creditors wrote
OL,13,     Foff debts that the country had
OL,14,     Flittle realistic chance of
OL,15,     Frepaying. It was the result of a
OL,16,     Fcampaign that included figures
OL,17,     Flike rock star Bono.
